     "do": [
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "MIMD exploits thread-level and request-level parallelism"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "But how do you program a thousand processors? Usually with one program: SPMD, single program, multiple data."
